  "observations": "The oblique and north-up views show all five separately placed pavilions on the unchanged campus field. The Hornstein and Stewart volumes meet along their uphill side, with distinct roofs and different street elevations. The Sherbrooke Street corridor stays clear between the historic buildings and Desmarais. Bourgie's belfry and attached hall read separately. The Desmarais connector reaches the Pavilion for Peace on the lower parcel. Ground registration, minor inter-building junctions, roof equipment and secondary elevations are approximate at available source resolution.",
